<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0056/e_0007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "measurement of serum creatinine, eGFR, electrolytes, and ACR" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0056/tu_0003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "To evaluate for the presence of HMOD, measurement of serum creatinine, eGFR, electrolytes, and ACR is recommended for all patients. A 12-lead ECG is recommended for all patients, and echocardiography is recommended for those with ECG abnormalities or signs/symptoms of LV dysfunction. Fundoscopy or retinal imaging is recommended for patients with grades 2 or 3 hypertension and all hypertensive patients with DM." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0056/e_0028/normalization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/EntityNormalization> .
